### Register a new account
### Account created in INACTIVE state. OTP sent via email.

POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "testuser",
  "password": "Test@123456",
  "fullName": "Test User",
  "email": "testuser@example.com",
  "phone": "0987654321",
  "siteKey": "DEFAULT"
}
